{
  "bookId": "hero-212018",
  "id": "bond-28596",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28596001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "你怎么这么快就回来了？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28596003",
              "text": "你要出门？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "28596003",
              "text": "这是要去哪里？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28596002",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28596003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "作为一名战场清道夫，当然是要去废墟搜寻自己的「猎物」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28596004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "瞧，探险地图我都准备好了，我已经迫不及待要大显身手了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28596006",
              "text": "听起来会是有趣的冒险。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28596005",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28596006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "「有趣」？这个形容太肤浅了吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28596007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "我可是靠着在废墟中的「冒险」，一步步成为今天的自己的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28596008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "这是我的生存方式，也就是我的一部分。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28596010",
              "text": "那么，我也可以参加吗？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28596009",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28596010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "你看起来没什么经验，不过经过调教或许能有用处，跟我来吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "28596",
